        </div>
        <p class="lp-feature-desc">JWT + Keycloak/Entra ID/Cognito authentication, policy-based authorization, Vault integration, and GDPR privacy helpers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <div class="lp-feature-header">
          <div class="lp-feature-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0l-1 3m8.5-3l1 3m0 0l.5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0l-.5 1.5m.75-9l3-3 2.148 2.148A12.061 12.061 0 0116.5 7.605" /></svg></div>
